<title>PHILIPPINES: Basic plans one-for-two stock rights.</title>
<headline>Basic plans one-for-two stock rights.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Basic Petroleum &amp; Minerals Inc plans a one-for-two stock rights offering to partly fund its exploration and diversification projects, documents submitted to the Philippine Securities and Exchange Commission on Monday showed.</p>
<p>The offer is to cover its latest capital increase to 2.0 billion pesos from 1.0 billion pesos.</p>
<p>No record date had been set by the oil explorer.</p>
<p>- Manila newsroom 632 8418938 Fax 8176267</p>
</text>
